# ai-models.schema — who may set each key of the `ai-models` subsystem (see w-conf.md).
# Format: <KEY>\t<scope>   scope: system | user | both
#
# Where the machine keeps tens (or hundreds) of gigabytes of model weights is a
# root-domain decision: the directory is shared by every AI service on the box,
# lives outside any home, is owned by a system group, and moving it is a disk
# layout choice an admin makes — not a per-account preference. One user pointing
# the store at their own path would silently strand every other account's
# downloads and every service already running against the old one.
DIR	system
